<title>FINLAND: KESKO JULY SALES FALL PCT YR/YR.</title>
<headline>KESKO JULY SALES FALL PCT YR/YR.</headline>
<dateline>HELSINKI 1997-08-15</dateline>
<text>
<p>Finnish wholesaler and retailer Kesko Oy said in a statement on Friday that group sales excluding value-added-tax (VAT) fell 2.8 percent year-on-year in July to 2.92 billion markka.  </p>
<p>Kesko's daily goods sales fell 2.8 percent in July on the year-ago period to 2.92 billion markka while sales of perishable goods rose 7.2 percent to 1,630 million markka.</p>
<p>The group's January-July sales rose 18.1 percent year-on-year to 20.69 billion markka.</p>
<p>--Helsinki newsroom +358-9-680 50 245, news@reuters.fi</p>
